  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Wurrband",
    "summary": "**[[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic)** attacks made by your **ORKS PSYKER** models get +1 **S**, plus another +1 **S** per 5 models in the model's unit (or embarked within that model).\n\nThese models also have 2 **psychic abilities**, each of psychic level 1:\n\n**Roar of Mork**: during your Movement phase, provided the model's unit isn't **battle-shocked**, you may roll one D6 as a **psychic roll** for that unit. If you do:\n\n- A roll of 1 makes that unit battle-shocked.\n- Whatever the result, pick one enemy unit within 12\" of it, other than a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit; that enemy unit takes a **battle-shock roll** at -1 per 10 models in the **PSYKER**'s unit.\n\n**Visions of Violence**: as any Fight phase begins, provided the model's unit isn't battle-shocked, you may roll one D6 as a **psychic roll** for that unit. If you do:\n\n- A roll of 1 makes that unit battle-shocked.\n- Whatever the result, that unit has **[Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first)** for the rest of that phase.",
